    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/c85f095fe6295ff34b17fd2431a8b8d6.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/627d3e3a76839ca891ae51aa231dd785.poster.avif?t=1754301533\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/627d3e3a76839ca891ae51aa231dd785.webm?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/627d3e3a76839ca891ae51aa231dd785.mp4?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/b3897594d731be84e23f236c318e2679.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafate</strong> is a cozy game where you play as a mail carrier who captures breathtaking photographs and delivers letters to the warm-hearted inhabitants of Mafate, a secluded valley in the heart of an Indian Ocean island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by Luna, a young Creole girl <strong>transformed into a camera</strong>, <strong>take control of animals</strong> to access hidden areas and explore this cozy and magical world. Care for the animals, interact with the villagers, solve their little troubles, and bring harmony and life to your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/dc036c156e21553ecf298b9dbebcbd1c.poster.avif?t=1754301533\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/dc036c156e21553ecf298b9dbebcbd1c.webm?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/dc036c156e21553ecf298b9dbebcbd1c.mp4?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/cc6249ab78c19f7d34c4efd817cf6799.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtly <strong>identify unique life moments</strong>, each offering distinct possibilities. Position yourself for the <strong>perfect shot.</strong> Experiment with and evaluate your composition through an innovative rating system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/3fba7b627c61812f0cceb9b63f64a1de.poster.avif?t=1754301533\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/3fba7b627c61812f0cceb9b63f64a1de.webm?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/3fba7b627c61812f0cceb9b63f64a1de.mp4?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/4fe62be22916d1395b00f488ef8c45f8.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luna\u2019s spirit can leave the camera and possess specific animals. Explore hidden areas using their unique abilities. Unlock new interactions and solve puzzles by tapping into their instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/44cd8c70dc11f2c1dac462c1b560cd57.poster.avif?t=1754301533\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/44cd8c70dc11f2c1dac462c1b560cd57.webm?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/44cd8c70dc11f2c1dac462c1b560cd57.mp4?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/94ee955141c5dec2330adfe80402d4d5.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the touching story of a mail carrier connecting isolated villages, weaving bonds, and sharing stories. Immerse yourself in warm and heartfelt adventures while exploring the magic of a vibrant, mystical valley from R\u00e9union Island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafate </strong>tells the story of Luna, a young Creole girl who, after spending her entire life in mainland France, returns to her native island, R\u00e9union, to comfort her grandmother following her grandfather\u2019s passing. A mysterious event transports her back in time, transforming her into a camera. She finds herself in the R\u00e9union of the 1970s, witnessing the first delivery route of a man who would become a legend\u2014the Mafate mail carrier.<br><br>---<br>Credits<br>Music :\u00a0Folk_acoustic - PixaBay</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/c85f095fe6295ff34b17fd2431a8b8d6.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/627d3e3a76839ca891ae51aa231dd785.poster.avif?t=1754301533\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/627d3e3a76839ca891ae51aa231dd785.webm?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/627d3e3a76839ca891ae51aa231dd785.mp4?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/b3897594d731be84e23f236c318e2679.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafate</strong> is a cozy game where you play as a mail carrier who captures breathtaking photographs and delivers letters to the warm-hearted inhabitants of Mafate, a secluded valley in the heart of an Indian Ocean island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by Luna, a young Creole girl <strong>transformed into a camera</strong>, <strong>take control of animals</strong> to access hidden areas and explore this cozy and magical world. Care for the animals, interact with the villagers, solve their little troubles, and bring harmony and life to your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor