specific animals. Explore hidden areas using their unique abilities. Unlock new interactions and solve puzzles by tapping into their instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/44cd8c70dc11f2c1dac462c1b560cd57.poster.avif?t=1754301533\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/44cd8c70dc11f2c1dac462c1b560cd57.webm?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/44cd8c70dc11f2c1dac462c1b560cd57.mp4?t=1754301533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133220/extras/94ee955141c5dec2330adfe80402d4d5.avif?t=1754301533\" data-has-big width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the touching story of a mail carrier connecting isolated villages, weaving bonds, and sharing stories. Immerse yourself in warm and heartfelt adventures while exploring the magic of a vibrant, mystical valley from R\u00e9union Island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafate </strong>tells the story of Luna, a young Creole girl who, after spending her entire life in mainland France, returns to her native island, R\u00e9union, to comfort her grandmother following her grandfather\u2019s passing. A mysterious event transports her back in time, transforming her into a camera. She finds herself in the R\u00e9union of the 1970s, witnessing the first delivery route of a man who would become a legend\u2014the Mafate mail carrier.<br><br>---<br>Credits<br>Music :\u00a0Folk_acoustic - PixaBay</p>",
